# Icons — Hugeicons only (platform-wide)

Crawllex uses **Hugeicons free Stroke Rounded** for all UI chrome icons.

## Do

- Import from `Icons` in `lib/frontend/icons/app-icons.ts` (or extend that map with `createAppIcon`)
- Use `AppIcon` / integer `size` + `absoluteStrokeWidth` for crisp rendering
- Keep brand SVGs for Google auth (`GoogleBrandMark`) and GSC/GA4 (`GoogleIntegrationLogo`)

## Don't

- ❌ Install or import `react-icons`, Lucide, Heroicons, Simple Icons, etc.
- ❌ Import `@hugeicons/core-free-icons` ad hoc in feature files when an `Icons.*` entry should exist
- ❌ Put circular bordered wells around sidebar nav icons (`sidebarNavIconClass` = bare glyphs)

Canonical rules: `AGENTS.md` → **Icons (Must Follow)** · `doc/frontend.md`.
